<%- include('partials/head') %>

<body class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-100 to-fuchsia-200 min-h-screen text-gray-800">
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center text-purple-700 mb-8">Help & Support</h1>

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-fuchsia-600 mb-4">How Can We Help?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
          If you're experiencing issues or have questions about our services, you're in the right place.
          We’ve compiled answers to common questions and support options below.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-fuchsia-600 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-lg space-y-3">
          <li><strong>How do I reset my password?</strong> Go to the login page and click on “Forgot Password”.</li>
          <li><strong>Can I upgrade my plan?</strong> Yes, visit the account settings page to upgrade anytime.</li>
          <li><strong>Where can I view my invoices?</strong> All billing info is available in your account dashboard.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-fuchsia-600 mb-4">Still Need Help?</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Our support team is available 24/7 to assist you. Whether it's technical assistance, billing questions, or general feedback, we’re here to help.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-fuchsia-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-medium hover:shadow-lg transition-all">
          Contact Support
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
